e=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-05-06/03-mistralai-mistral-medium-3-5-128b.png\" alt=\"mistralai/Mistral-Medium-3.5-128B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">mistralai/Mistral-Medium-3.5-128B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Mistral-Medium-3.5-128B是Mistral AI推出的旗舰级稠密模型，拥有256k的超长上下文窗口。该模型在指令遵循、复杂推理及编程能力方面表现优异，整合了多项任务处理能力，旨在替代旧版模型，为用户提供更卓越的逻辑推理和代码生成表现，适用于各类高性能开发与复杂逻辑分析任务。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-05-06/04-sulphurai-sulphur-2-base.png\" alt=\"SulphurAI/Sulphur-2-base\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">SulphurAI/Sulphur-2-base</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Sulphur-2-base是一款基于LTX 2.3架构的无审查视频生成模型。该模型原生支持文本生成视频（t2v）与图像生成视频（i2v）等多种格式，具备强大的视觉生成扩展性。由于其无审查特性，该模型主要用于探索创意视频内容的生成，为开发者与艺术家提供更自由的创作空间和多种格式兼容性支持。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-05-06/05-xiaomimimo-mimo-v2-5-pro.png\" alt=\"XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.5-Pro\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.5-Pro</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5-Pro是由小米推出的前沿人工智能模型，定位为多模态智能处理助手。该模型集成了先进的数据建模技术，专注于在移动端及云端提供高性能的交互体验。虽然相关具体参数公开有限，但作为MiMo系列的迭代版本，其核心功能在于优化多场景下的任务处理与响应能力，旨在为终端用户提供更智能的服务。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src